**Design Rationale Summary:**

| Milestone | Rule Type | Justification |
|-----------|-----------|---------------|
| find emerald_block | `position_near_with_facing` | Preferred for find/locate tasks (preference #4). Models "player can see the target" by requiring proximity (≤5 blocks) and facing (±60°). max_distance=5 chosen because the pillar is ~11.3 blocks from spawn, so the player must actively navigate there. |
| mine podzol | `inventory_has` | Preferred for mine tasks (preference #1). Silk Touch on the provided shovel ensures podzol drops as podzol item. No podzol exists in starting inventory, eliminating false positives. |

**Dependency enforcement:** The emerald pillar at z=8 is closer to spawn than the podzol shed at z=11-14. The player naturally approaches and "finds" the pillar first (triggering milestone 1), then discovers the shed behind it to mine podzol (triggering milestone 2). The max_distance=5 constraint on milestone 1 positions the player close enough to see the shed entrance.

